    "title": "Man in life-threatening condition after car strikes bicyclist in Waynedale's northside - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Grace Samels ,\n2 hours ago\nFORT WAYNE, Ind. (WANE) — Police are responding to reports of a crash involving a bicyclist in the south side of Fort Wayne.\nThe crash occurred at the intersection of Winchester and Bluffton Roads.\nPolice told a WANE 15 crew member at the scene that a pickup had struck a man riding a bike near the intersection, and that his injuries are life-threatening.\nA WANE 15 crew member at the scene observed at least 5 police vehicles and a pickup truck stopped in the road.\nThis story will be updated as more information becomes available.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WANE 15.",
